{"seq":3,"slug":"case-sla-escalation","title":"工单 SLA 与升级","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/reconciliation-exception-case-platform/case-investigation-sla/case-sla-escalation","wordCount":2296,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"工单-sla-与升级\">工单 SLA 与升级</h1><p>&quot;这张单 3 天内处理完&quot;这句话在系统里实现起来比听起来难得多。难点不在设置一个截止时间字段，而在：3 天是自然日还是工作日？北京时间凌晨 2 点创建的单，时钟从什么时候开始走？等渠道回函的两周算不算在内？如果一张单在最后半小时被升级了，原负责人和新负责人谁背这个超时？这些问题每一条都会在生产环境里发生，而每一条的默认答案都可能是错的。SLA 的正确实现方式是把&quot;承诺时限&quot;建模成一个<strong>可暂停、可恢复、按日历计算、随优先级变化</strong>的时钟，并把这个时钟的每一次变化都记成事件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-sla-时钟的四个组成部分\">核心概念：SLA 时钟的四个组成部分</h2><p>一个可用的 SLA 模型需要同时定义四件事，缺一个就会在某个边界情况下算错：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;工单创建&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;1 起点规则&lt;br/&gt;创建时刻 or 下个工作时开始&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; C[&quot;2 目标时长&lt;br/&gt;由优先级推导&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; D[&quot;3 日历&lt;br/&gt;工作日/时区/节假日&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; E[&quot;4 暂停规则&lt;br/&gt;哪些状态不计时&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; F[&quot;截止时刻&quot;]&#10;  F --&gt; G{&quot;到期前完成？&quot;}&#10;  G --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| H[&quot;按时关闭&lt;br/&gt;计入达成率&quot;]&#10;  G --&gt;|&quot;否&quot;| I[&quot;按层级升级&quot;]&#10;  I --&gt; J[&quot;重新计算目标&lt;br/&gt;记录升级事件&quot;]\">graph TD\n  A[\"工单创建\"] --&gt; B[\"1 起点规则&lt;br/&gt;创建时刻 or 下个工作时开始\"]\n  B --&gt; C[\"2 目标时长&lt;br/&gt;由优先级推导\"]\n  C --&gt; D[\"3 日历&lt;br/&gt;工作日/时区/节假日\"]\n  D --&gt; E[\"4 暂停规则&lt;br/&gt;哪些状态不计时\"]\n  E --&gt; F[\"截止时刻\"]\n  F --&gt; G{\"到期前完成？\"}\n  G --&gt;|\"是\"| H[\"按时关闭&lt;br/&gt;计入达成率\"]\n  G --&gt;|\"否\"| I[\"按层级升级\"]\n  I --&gt; J[\"重新计算目标&lt;br/&gt;记录升级事件\"]</pre><p>把这四件事分开定义，而不是揉成一个&quot;deadline&quot;字段，带来的直接好处是：<strong>任何一次时限争议都可以拆解到具体是哪一部分的规则不认同</strong>，而不是陷入&quot;我觉得这单不该算超时&quot;的无效争论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"优先级矩阵-从影响与紧急度推导目标时长\">优先级矩阵：从影响与紧急度推导目标时长</h2><h3 id=\"影响-紧急度\">影响 × 紧急度</h3><p>优先级不应该是手动选择的枚举值，而应该由两个可观测的维度推导：影响（这笔差异有多大、涉及多少钱、是否影响结账）与紧急度（是否已阻塞下游、是否临近结账日、是否涉及监管报送）。这个思路直接来自 ITIL 的优先级模型——优先级由影响与紧急度共同决定（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Incident_management_(ITSM)\">Incident management</a>）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>影响 \\ 紧急度</th>\n<th>低</th>\n<th>中</th>\n<th>高</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>高</strong>（金额 ≥ 100k 或影响结账）</td>\n<td>P2 / 3 工作日</td>\n<td>P1 / 1 工作日</td>\n<td>P0 / 4 小时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>中</strong>（1k–100k）</td>\n<td>P3 / 10 工作日</td>\n<td>P2 / 3 工作日</td>\n<td>P1 / 1 工作日</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>低</strong>（&lt; 1k）</td>\n<td>P4 / 30 工作日</td>\n<td>P3 / 10 工作日</td>\n<td>P2 / 3 工作日</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张矩阵的每一格都是一条策略数据而不是代码常量——因为不同业务线对&quot;大额&quot;的定义不同，对&quot;紧急&quot;的定义也不同（大促期间的紧急度基线会上移）。把它做成配置项，才能在业务变化时不动代码。</p>\n<h3 id=\"影响与紧急度的可计算化\">影响与紧急度的可计算化</h3><p>让优先级&quot;可由数据推导&quot;而不是由人填写，需要把两个维度都写成表达式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;priority_policy_id&quot;: &quot;PP-GLOBAL-2026Q3&quot;,&#10;  &quot;impact&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;high&quot;: { &quot;any&quot;: [{ &quot;amount_minor_gte&quot;: 10000000 }, { &quot;blocks_close&quot;: true }, { &quot;regulatory_reporting&quot;: true }] },&#10;    &quot;medium&quot;: { &quot;any&quot;: [{ &quot;amount_minor_gte&quot;: 100000 }, { &quot;same_channel_open_cases_gte&quot;: 50 }] },&#10;    &quot;low&quot;: { &quot;always&quot;: true }&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;urgency&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;high&quot;: { &quot;any&quot;: [{ &quot;days_to_period_close_lte&quot;: 1 }, { &quot;downstream_blocked&quot;: true }] },&#10;    &quot;medium&quot;: { &quot;any&quot;: [{ &quot;days_to_period_close_lte&quot;: 5 }, { &quot;channel_reply_pending&quot;: true }] },&#10;    &quot;low&quot;: { &quot;always&quot;: true }&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;target_by_priority&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;P0&quot;: { &quot;duration_hours&quot;: 4, &quot;calendar&quot;: &quot;24x7&quot; },&#10;    &quot;P1&quot;: { &quot;duration_hours&quot;: 8, &quot;calendar&quot;: &quot;business_days&quot; },&#10;    &quot;P2&quot;: { &quot;duration_days&quot;: 3, &quot;calendar&quot;: &quot;business_days&quot; },&#10;    &quot;P3&quot;: { &quot;duration_days&quot;: 10, &quot;calendar&quot;: &quot;business_days&quot; },&#10;    &quot;P4&quot;: { &quot;duration_days&quot;: 30, &quot;calendar&quot;: &quot;business_days&quot; }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"priority_policy_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"PP-GLOBAL-2026Q3\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"impact\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"high\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"any\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [{ </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"amount_minor_gte\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10000000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }, { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"blocks_close\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }, { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"regulatory_reporting\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }] },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"medium\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"any\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [{ </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"amount_minor_gte\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }, { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"same_channel_open_cases_gte\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }] },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"low\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"always\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"urgency\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"high\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"any\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [{ </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"days_to_period_close_lte\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }, { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"downstream_blocked\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }] },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"medium\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"any\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [{ </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"days_to_period_close_lte\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }, { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"channel_reply_pending\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }] },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"low\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"always\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"target_by_priority\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"P0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"duration_hours\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"calendar\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"24x7\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"P1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"duration_hours\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"calendar\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"business_days\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"P2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"duration_days\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"calendar\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"business_days\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"P3\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"duration_days\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"calendar\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"business_days\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"P4\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"duration_days\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"calendar\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"business_days\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意 <code>P0</code> 用的是 <code>24x7</code> 日历——一笔临近结账日的大额短款不会因为今天是周末就不紧急。而 <code>P2</code> 用工作日日历，因为 3 天的承诺本身已经隐含了&quot;不指望周末处理&quot;的假设。<strong>同一套系统里必须允许不同优先级用不同日历</strong>，这是最容易被简化掉、也最容易引发争议的一点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"日历与截止时刻的计算\">日历与截止时刻的计算</h2><h3 id=\"工作日历的构成\">工作日历的构成</h3><p>工作日历需要三样东西：时区、法定节假日、以及企业自定义的非工作日（比如盘点日）。跨境场景里时区问题尤其突出——同一条策略对亚太组和欧洲组生效时，同一个&quot;3 个工作日&quot;会算出不同的绝对时刻。</p>\n<p>截止时刻的计算必须显式按目标的日历推进，而不是&quot;加 N 天&quot;：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def compute_deadline(start_ts, duration, calendar, tz):&#10;    remaining = duration&#10;    cursor = start_ts.astimezone(tz)&#10;    while remaining &gt; timedelta(0):&#10;        if calendar.is_working(cursor):&#10;            window_end = calendar.day_end(cursor)&#10;            step = min(remaining, window_end - cursor)&#10;            cursor += step&#10;            remaining -= step&#10;            if remaining &gt; timedelta(0):&#10;                cursor = calendar.next_day_start(cursor)&#10;        else:&#10;            cursor = calendar.next_day_start(cursor)&#10;    return cursor\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> compute_deadline</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(start_ts, duration, calendar, tz):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    remaining </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> duration</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    cursor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> start_ts.astimezone(tz)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> remaining </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> timedelta(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> calendar.is_working(cursor):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            window_end </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> calendar.day_end(cursor)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            step </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(remaining, window_end </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cursor)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            cursor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> step</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            remaining </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> step</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> remaining </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> timedelta(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                cursor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> calendar.next_day_start(cursor)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            cursor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> calendar.next_day_start(cursor)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cursor</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这个循环有一个必须注意的性质：<strong>它是按&quot;工作窗口&quot;而非&quot;整天&quot;累加的</strong>。如果目标时长是 8 小时而工作日窗口是 8 小时，工单在下午 3 点创建，那么它会在下一个工作日的同一时刻到期，而不是当天下班前。归零处理要显式，否则浮点或负数会出问题。</p>\n<h3 id=\"起点规则的选择\">起点规则的选择</h3><p>起点规则有两种，选择本身就是一条业务承诺：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>起点规则</th>\n<th>行为</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>on_create</code></td>\n<td>从创建时刻起算</td>\n<td>7×24 值班的团队</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>next_work_window</code></td>\n<td>从下一个工作窗口开始起算</td>\n<td>仅工作日办公的团队</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>用 <code>next_work_window</code> 会在周五 22:00 创建的单上产生&quot;时钟周一早上才开始走&quot;的效果，这在只有工作日办公的团队里是诚实的承诺；而如果对同一张单用了 <code>on_create</code>，它会在周一早上就已经超时，引发一轮无意义的升级。<strong>起点规则必须与分派策略一致</strong>：如果路由能在周末把单分给值班组（见 <a href=\"exception-case-assign\">例外工单分派与路由</a>），起点规则就应该用 <code>on_create</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"升级机制\">升级机制</h2><h3 id=\"功能升级与层级升级\">功能升级与层级升级</h3><p>升级有两种，混在一起谈会失焦（ITIL 的经典区分，同上）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>触发</th>\n<th>动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>功能升级</td>\n<td>需要更强的专业能力</td>\n<td>调查发现超出当前处理人技能</td>\n<td>转给专家队列，原人可继续协助</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>层级升级</td>\n<td>需要更高的决策权限或资源</td>\n<td>临近或已超时</td>\n<td>通知上级，纳入其待办</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>两者的技术实现不同：功能升级改的是处理人技能集合，层级升级改的是<strong>责任人链</strong>。一张单可以在同一天里既功能升级（转给支付专家）又层级升级（通知组长），这两个记录应当分别落库，因为它们回答的是不同问题——&quot;当时为什么找不到会的人&quot;与&quot;当时为什么没人管&quot;。</p>\n<h3 id=\"升级阶梯与自动动作\">升级阶梯与自动动作</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>升级层级</th>\n<th>自动动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>剩余时间 &lt; 25% 且未开始调查</td>\n<td>+1</td>\n<td>提醒处理人 + 队列看板标黄</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>超时 0–4 小时</td>\n<td>+1</td>\n<td>通知组长，工单进组长待办</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>超时 4–24 小时</td>\n<td>+2</td>\n<td>通知运营负责人，纳入日报</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>超时 &gt; 24 小时</td>\n<td>+3</td>\n<td>触发容量/流程复盘，进入治理章节的根因分析候选</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一行的连接很重要：<strong>持续超时的工单不是个人绩效问题，通常是有系统性原因的</strong>——技能矩阵缺人、渠道回复周期长、或者某类差异本身在流程上无法在时限内查清。这些原因只能通过 <a href=\"../exception-governance/exception-trend-rootcause\">差异趋势与根因分析</a> 被识别并修复，而不是靠不断加压。</p>\n<h3 id=\"升级不得重置时钟\">升级不得重置时钟</h3><p>一个必须写进规范的约定：<strong>升级不重置 SLA 时钟，也不改变原始目标时刻</strong>。理由很直接——如果升级能重置时钟，系统就会激励&quot;临到期就升级&quot;的行为，超时率会显得很好而实际问题被掩盖。</p>\n<p>但升级可以附加新的目标：比如层级升级后要求&quot;24 小时内给出阶段性结论&quot;。这是<strong>叠加而不是替换</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE case_sla_state (&#10;  case_id          BIGINT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  priority         TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  started_at       TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  target_at        TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  paused_total     INTERVAL NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;0&#39;,&#10;  current_state    TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  met              BOOLEAN,&#10;  closed_at        TIMESTAMPTZ&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE case_sla_event (&#10;  event_id   BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  case_id    BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;  kind       TEXT NOT NULL CHECK (kind IN&#10;               (&#39;start&#39;,&#39;pause&#39;,&#39;resume&#39;,&#39;reprioritize&#39;,&#39;escalate&#39;,&#39;extend&#39;,&#39;close&#39;)),&#10;  from_target TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  to_target   TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  reason     TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  actor      TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  at         TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now()&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION effective_deadline(p_case BIGINT) RETURNS TIMESTAMPTZ&#10;LANGUAGE sql STABLE AS $$&#10;  SELECT target_at + paused_total FROM case_sla_state WHERE case_id = p_case;&#10;$$;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> case_sla_state</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  case_id          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  priority         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  started_at       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  target_at        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  paused_total     INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '0'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  current_state    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  met              </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BOOLEAN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  closed_at        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> case_sla_event</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  event_id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  case_id    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  kind       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (kind </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">               (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'start'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'pause'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'resume'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'reprioritize'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'escalate'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'extend'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'close'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  from_target </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  to_target   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  reason     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  actor      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE OR REPLACE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FUNCTION</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> effective_deadline</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(p_case </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">RETURNS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TIMESTAMPTZ</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LANGUAGE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> sql</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> STABLE </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $$</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> target_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> paused_total </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> case_sla_state </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> case_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p_case;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$$;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>把 <code>paused_total</code> 独立存储而不是在每次查询时遍历暂停事件，是为了让截止时刻的计算是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的；同时 <code>case_sla_event</code> 保留了完整历史，两者互为校验。<code>extend</code> 是唯一允许后移 <code>target_at</code> 的事件类型，且它必须带 <code>reason</code> 和 <code>actor</code>——<strong>延期是一个需要留痕的决策，不是一个可以静默执行的字段更新</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"暂停规则与它的滥用边界\">暂停规则与它的滥用边界</h2><h3 id=\"哪些状态可以暂停\">哪些状态可以暂停</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>状态</th>\n<th>是否暂停</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>pending_external</code>（等渠道回复）</td>\n<td>是，但有单次与累计上限</td>\n<td>等外部属我方不可控</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>等待审批人</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>审批是我方内部流程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>等待补充材料（我方索要）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>同上</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>队列无人可接</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>容量问题是内部问题，必须暴露</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>后三行的共同逻辑是：<strong>暂停时钟会掩盖内部问题，所以只有外部依赖可以暂停</strong>。这与 <a href=\"exception-case-assign\">例外工单分派与路由</a> 中的约定一致，也与 <a href=\"evidence-link-investigate\">证据挂链与调查作业</a> 中给暂停设上限的要求呼应。</p>\n<h3 id=\"超时率的正确统计\">超时率的正确统计</h3><p>达成率不能只统计&quot;已关闭工单里按时完成的比例&quot;——那会漏掉那些永远没关闭、一直在超时状态里的工单，从而系统性高估表现。正确口径是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>按时达成率</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">#</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext>在目标时刻前关闭</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">#</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext>目标时刻已到达的全部工单</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{按时达成率} = \\frac{\\#\\{\\text{在目标时刻前关闭}\\}}{\\#\\{\\text{目标时刻已到达的全部工单}\\}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">按时达成率</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">#</span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">目标时刻已到达的全部工单</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">#</span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">在目标时刻前关闭</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>分母是&quot;目标时刻已到达&quot;，而不是&quot;已关闭&quot;。这样一张挂了三个月的超时工单会持续出现在分母里，无法通过不关闭它来美化指标。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT date_trunc(&#39;week&#39;, s.target_at) AS wk,&#10;       count(*)                                                    AS reached,&#10;       count(*) FILTER (WHERE s.closed_at &lt;= s.target_at + s.paused_total) AS on_time,&#10;       round(100.0 * count(*) FILTER (WHERE s.closed_at &lt;= s.target_at + s.paused_total)&#10;             / greatest(count(*), 1), 2)                           AS on_time_pct&#10;FROM case_sla_state s&#10;WHERE s.target_at &lt; now()&#10;GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1 DESC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> date_trunc(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'week'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">target_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> wk,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                                                    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reached,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">closed_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">target_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">paused_total</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> on_time,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       round</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">closed_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">target_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">paused_total</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">             /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> greatest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                           </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> on_time_pct</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> case_sla_state s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">target_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>SLA 由四部分组成：起点规则、目标时长、日历、暂停规则。分开定义才能让时限争议落到具体规则上。</li>\n<li>优先级由影响 × 紧急度推导，两者都要写成可计算表达式；不同优先级可以用不同日历（P0 用 24×7，P2 用工作日）。</li>\n<li>起点规则必须与分派策略一致：能在周末分单的团队才该用 <code>on_create</code>。</li>\n<li>功能升级改技能集合，层级升级改责任人链，两者分开记录；<strong>升级不重置时钟</strong>，只叠加新目标。</li>\n<li>只有外部依赖状态可以暂停时钟；达成率的分母是&quot;目标时刻已到达的工单&quot;，不是&quot;已关闭的工单&quot;。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>工单有了结论之后，差异的钱要落到账上——见下一章 <a href=\"../suspense-writeoff/suspense-account-posting\">挂账分录与过渡账户</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"工单 SLA 与升级","id":"工单-sla-与升级"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：SLA 时钟的四个组成部分","id":"核心概念-sla-时钟的四个组成部分"},{"level":2,"text":"优先级矩阵：从影响与紧急度推导目标时长","id":"优先级矩阵-从影响与紧急度推导目标时长"},{"level":3,"text":"影响 × 紧急度","id":"影响-紧急度"},{"level":3,"text":"影响与紧急度的可计算化","id":"影响与紧急度的可计算化"},{"level":2,"text":"日历与截止时刻的计算","id":"日历与截止时刻的计算"},{"level":3,"text":"工作日历的构成","id":"工作日历的构成"},{"level":3,"text":"起点规则的选择","id":"起点规则的选择"},{"level":2,"text":"升级机制","id":"升级机制"},{"level":3,"text":"功能升级与层级升级","id":"功能升级与层级升级"},{"level":3,"text":"升级阶梯与自动动作","id":"升级阶梯与自动动作"},{"level":3,"text":"升级不得重置时钟","id":"升级不得重置时钟"},{"level":2,"text":"暂停规则与它的滥用边界","id":"暂停规则与它的滥用边界"},{"level":3,"text":"哪些状态可以暂停","id":"哪些状态可以暂停"},{"level":3,"text":"超时率的正确统计","id":"超时率的正确统计"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"证据挂链与调查作业","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/reconciliation-exception-case-platform/case-investigation-sla/evidence-link-investigate"},"next":{"title":"挂账分录与过渡账户","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/reconciliation-exception-case-platform/suspense-writeoff/suspense-account-posting"}}